      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CapMonster Cloud — reCAPTCHA v2 (ZennoLab Test)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\n1. **Run Test** — manual trigger\n2. **HTTP Request** — fetches the latest browser User-Agent from CapMonster Cloud\n3. **Solve reCAPTCHA v2** — solves the CAPTCHA on the ZennoLab test page\n4. **Submit Form with Token** — POSTs `g-recaptcha-response` to the form endpoint\n5. **Parse Response** — extracts the JSON result from the HTML `<pre>` tag\n\n**Parameters:**\n- **URL:** https://lessons.zennolab.com/captchas/recaptcha/v2_simple.php?level=high\n- **Sitekey:** `6Lcg7CMUAAAAANphynKgn9YAgA4tQ2KI_iqRyTwd`\n- **Submit endpoint:** POST /captchas/recaptcha/verify.php?type=v2&subtype=simple&level=high\n\n**Credentials:** CapMonster Cloud API — https://dash.capmonster.cloud",
